@startuml
title b LINE / break LINE — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
:Parse positive source line;
:Resolve deepest supported statement, loop-body nested blocks stay atomic;
if (Source target valid?) then (yes)
:Store or replace breakpoint for requested line, rearm stop;
:Display resolved range, do not execute program or condition;
else (no)
:Report command error without changing breakpoints;
endif
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
